<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόπτρον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the wood in a trap</i> which falls when touched and
			catches the mouse, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.115
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκης ἔπαισεν αὐτὸν
			ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1172
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>musical instrument</i> of the Corybantes, <i>tambourine</i>
			or <i>kettle-drum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Trag.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Frr.</u>
				105
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				152
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.74
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. βυρσοπαγῆ καὶ κοῖλα περιτείναντες
					ἠχείοις χαλκοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόμβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>knocker</i> on a door, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1612
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				6.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.4.36
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόπαλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			.</div>
